## Background sync (local-first)

| Слой | Что |
|---|---|
| Task | `mail_sync_tick` + `mail_sync_binding` + `mail_rag_index` + `mail_idle_supervisor` (`apps/idle_worker/tasks/`) |
| Schedule | cron `mail_sync` (default `*/1`); IDLE supervisor на том же cron при `idle_enabled` |
| Context | перед sync/mutations/rag-index — `enter_mail_binding_context` + `build_job_context` (JWT): `MailService._active_user_id` и RAG/files/office. Recipients (notify/push) = `binding.user_id` + прямые FGA `owner`/`member`/`manager` (не `list_users(can_view)`). Role job-actor: первый существующий recipient в компании, иначе `authz.list_users(mailbox_binding, can_admin, user_filters=[USER])` (TTU `admin from company`); нет actor → `raise` |
| Fairness | `list_sync_candidates` JOIN по `company_mail_connection_id` + `status=active` — company и personal в одном tick |
| Folders cache | `mailbox_folders` + `sort_index`; `GET /folders` DB-only `ORDER BY sort_index, folder_name`; **пустой кэш → `needs_sync=true`**; UI → `POST /sync` (IMAP LIST sync) → reload folders; IMAP refresh **сохраняет** известные `sort_index`, новые — в хвост; bootstrap — роль (inbox→sent→drafts→trash→archive→junk→other) затем имя |
| Messages | `mail_messages` + flags; list/search/thread/get — local; `needs_sync` на list = пустая папка **без** `last_synced_at` (не «пустой inbox навсегда») |
| Sync fidelity | UIDVALIDITY wipe, forward catch-up, history backfill, UID reconcile, flag refresh |
| Sync-now | `POST /sync` → `refresh_folders_from_imap` + enqueue `mail_sync_binding` |
| RAG index | Persist **без** sync ingest: upsert → `rag_index_status=pending|skipped` → enqueue `mail_rag_index`; status ∈ `{ready,pending,failed,skipped}`; UI молния на `failed` → `POST /messages/rag-index` retry; push `mail/message/upserted` |
| Mutations | trash/move/archive/delete/star/drafts/seen — optimistic local + TaskIQ + push |
| Role ACL | OpenFGA `mailbox_binding` (`member`=view, `manager`=edit/admin); RAG technical `mail-{mailbox_binding_id}` |
| Notify + live UI | `mail/message/upserted\|moved\|removed\|send_*` |
| Send | Message-Id domain из **binding → connection** (`allocate_outbound_message_id`); `prepare_send_local` → enqueue SMTP+APPEND → sync |
| Personal connect | healthcheck → save connection/binding → **сразу** `refresh_folders_from_imap` → enqueue sync |

Конфиг: `MailSyncConfig` (`backfill_batch_size`, `reconcile_every_n_syncs`, `idle_*`, …). Personal ns — **`namespace.mdc`**.

## Transport (`MailServerPort`)

list/fetch/send + `uid_store_flags`, `uid_move`, `uid_expunge`, `append_message`, `uid_search`, `fetch_flags_for_uids`, `open_idle_session`, `healthcheck_with_credentials`.

Wire folder = exact IMAP name; роли только SPECIAL-USE. Ensure: sent/drafts/trash/archive.

